WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.229
Week 20: Preterite and Imperfect Together. tell a coherent story explain circumstances identify cause and interruption

2
00:00:08.229 --> 00:00:15.817
Form and meaning. Foreground versus background; interruption; bounded versus ongoing events; narrative viewpoint.

3
00:00:15.817 --> 00:00:44.486
Model set. Caminaba a casa cuando empezó la tormenta. Mientras todos dormían, sonó la alarma. Ya había poca luz cuando llegamos. De repente, un vecino abrió la puerta. Al final resolvimos el problema juntos. I was walking home when the storm began. While everyone was sleeping, the alarm went off. There was already little light when we arrived. Suddenly, a neighbor opened the door. In the end, we solved the problem together.

4
00:00:44.486 --> 00:00:54.637
Contrastive practice. Change the person, time, number, or level of formality in each model. Preserve the communicative purpose while the grammar changes.

5
00:00:54.637 --> 00:01:07.882
Production check. Say one original sentence for each function: tell a coherent story; explain circumstances; identify cause and interruption. Then write it and compare the spoken and written forms.

6
00:01:07.882 --> 00:01:37.425
Model language. Caminaba a casa cuando empezó la tormenta. — I was walking home when the storm began. Mientras todos dormían, sonó la alarma. — While everyone was sleeping, the alarm went off. Ya había poca luz cuando llegamos. — There was already little light when we arrived. De repente, un vecino abrió la puerta. — Suddenly, a neighbor opened the door. Al final resolvimos el problema juntos. — In the end, we solved the problem together.

7
00:01:37.425 --> 00:01:47.323
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
